 mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">7,592</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">28<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">476</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,591</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">28<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">432</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">28<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">455</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">95</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">28<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,138</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">45.2</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">18w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">552</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">21.9</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">18w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">979</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">16.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">18w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">616</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">10.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">18w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">This is a thin mini-ITX case purchased from Taobao with tight space constraints requiring CPU coolers up to 40mm high. The build uses a low-power Intel i5-12500TE with 35w base TDP. The case has pre-designed cutouts for thin mini-ITX motherboards. A separate Intel AX200 WiFi 6 card with Eightwood antenna kit was added to utilize existing mounting holes. No discrete GPU is possible without external PCIe to NVMe adapters. The CPU cooler is 21mm high, rated for up to 75w TDP CPUs. The i5-12500TE is noted as weak compared to alternatives; the integrated UHD Graphics 770 is only suitable for basic office work and light video viewing, not gaming. The build is powered by a 19v 120w AC adapter with barrel jack connector. The motherboard can accept power bricks from 60w to 180w. The case is simple and relatively easy to build in. Performance is adequate for basic Windows operation, web surfing, YouTube, and video streaming. The build is recommended for basic workstation and HTPC use only. Alternatives like ASRock Deskmini with higher-end APUs would provide better gaming capability. The fan can reach above 45dB under heavy stress but remains quiet during idle and normal operation.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">7,592</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:5%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->95<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">271.1</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">35<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">21.9<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:3%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->97<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.22</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\">r/sffpc</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"t