ng holes. No discrete GPU is possible without external PCIe to NVMe adapters. The CPU cooler is 21mm high, rated for up to 75w TDP CPUs. The i5-12500TE is noted as weak compared to alternatives; the integrated UHD Graphics 770 is only suitable for basic office work and light video viewing, not gaming. The build is powered by a 19v 120w AC adapter with barrel jack connector. The motherboard can accept power bricks from 60w to 180w. The case is simple and relatively easy to build in. Performance is adequate for basic Windows operation, web surfing, YouTube, and video streaming. The build is recommended for basic workstation and HTPC use only. Alternatives like ASRock Deskmini with higher-end APUs would provide better gaming capability. The fan can reach above 45dB under heavy stress but remains quiet during idle and normal operation.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"16:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Builder notes\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$1a\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Performance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"CPU — CB23 Multi\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\